"Tholo hoards {0} from the kill.":"Tholo amasse {0} sur sa proie.",
"Tholo scoops up the Arena Chest!":"Tholo ramasse l'Arena Chest !",
"Tholo slayer":"Tueur de Tholo",
"Tholo stays in every deck (the rulebook removes him from Orpheus and the Juggernaut)":"Tholo reste dans chaque pioche (le livre de règles le retire d'Orpheus et du Juggernaut)",
"Tholo!":"Tholo !",
"Tholo! Tholo!":"Tholo ! Tholo !",
"Tholo's great blunted club for your tokens":"La grande massue émoussée de Tholo pour tes jetons",
"Tholo’s card is pulled once he is on the sand; the Hero stands as tall as the rest; Tholo looks like his card":"La carte de Tholo est retirée une fois qu'il est sur le sable ; le Hero est aussi grand que les autres ; Tholo ressemble à sa carte",
"Thorn":"Épine",
"Those who reached free agency will be in the recruiting pool of your next career.":"Ceux devenus agents libres seront dans le vivier de recrutement de ta prochaine carrière.",
